{
  "title": "Examiner-recorded irregular pulse does not establish added cross-cycle prediction of urinary albumin loss",
  "abstract": "Examiner-recorded pulse irregularity did not establish added frozen-model prediction of log urinary ACR in 4,938 NHANES 2009\u201310 adults: weighted MSE gain 0.00026720 (95% target-PSU interval -0.00015636 to 0.00068497) beyond flexible conventional measures. This is not a test of ECG-confirmed AF. Source five-fold cross-validation also did not improve; the target point gain was 0.035% of baseline loss. Separate sampling waves share a measurement system, so external-system validation remains unperformed.",
